# farkaskonyveles.hu staging build (`pnpm deploy:staging`) — public, no secrets.
# The site runs at the host root (https://farkaskonyveles.hu/) behind the
# login gate (deploy/pspro), noindex + disallow-all robots.txt until go-live.
# SFTP credentials live in .env.deploy.local (gitignored).
DEPLOY_BASE=/
VITE_DATA_SOURCE=json
VITE_FORM_HANDLER=noop
